## Network Jobs

Local skill suite for warm-intro job search. Data: `~/.network-jobs/` (see SCHEMA.md in the suite).

### Routing

| User intent | Skill |
|-------------|-------|
| First install / fill profile / LinkedIn export help | `network-jobs-setup` |
| Import a LinkedIn connections ZIP | `network-jobs-import` |
| Find career pages + stage open roles | `careers-discover` |
| Promote triage → searchable corpus | `jobs-ingest` |
| Search openings in my network | `network-jobs` |
| Draft a forwardable warm intro | `intro-email-generator` |

### Rules

- Never curl `jobs.hirefrank.com` — read local files under `~/.network-jobs/` only.
- Never invent job fields (salary, dates) that were not captured.
- `careers-discover` stages only; wait for user confirm before `jobs-ingest`.
- Prefer `agent-browser` for JS-heavy career sites; fall back to curl/WebFetch.
- Helpers ship inside each skill folder (`helpers/`). Suite root is also in `~/.network-jobs/suite-root` after `network-jobs setup`.
